      "section_raw": "Reason",
      "clause_path": null,
      "exact_quote": "Due to the misinterpretation of the prevailing requirements for multimaterial (hybrid) joints of the passenger door frame fittings, the interfay sealant, which prevents water ingress, was only applied on the surface in direct contact with the aluminium parts and not between all surfaces of the joint parts.",
      "start_char": null,
